  "Sign-in hasn’t completed. Finish it in your browser and click Reconnect, or open the server’s details to start again.": "登录尚未完成。请在浏览器中完成登录并点击“重新连接”，或打开该服务器的详情重新开始。",
  "Sign-in is taking longer than expected. If the sign-in window isn’t responding, close it and try again, or use Sign in another way.": "登录耗时比预期更长。如果登录窗口没有响应，请关闭它再试一次，或使用“其他登录方式”。",
