  "Signing algorithm": "签名算法",
  "Signing in from another browser? <link>Enter verification code</link>": "从另一个浏览器登录？<link>输入验证码</link>",
  "Signing in lets this run use the task’s computer along with the instructions you added.": "登录后，此次运行就可以使用该任务的计算机以及您添加的指令。",
  "Signing in lets this scheduled task access this computer when it runs.": "登录后，此计划任务在运行时就可以访问这台计算机。",
  "Signing in to Google Meet...": "正在登录 Google Meet...",
  "Signing in to “{host}” stopped at a prompt (for a password, one-time code, key passphrase or PIN) that was closed, could not be shown, or whose answer could not be delivered, so nothing was sent to the server. Try again and answer the prompt when it appears. If you normally sign in to this host with an SSH key that needs no prompt, that key was not accepted: check the username in SSH host (user@host), and that the key is loaded in your agent or set under SSH key.": "登录“{host}”时在提示（密码、一次性验证码、密钥密码短语或 PIN）处中断：该提示被关闭、无法显示，或其答案无法送达，因此没有向服务器发送任何内容。请重试，并在提示出现时作答。如果您通常使用无需提示的 SSH 密钥登录此主机，则说明该密钥未被接受：请检查 SSH 主机中的用户名（user@host）是否正确，以及该密钥是否已加载到您的代理中或在 SSH 密钥下进行了设置。",
  "Signing in to “{host}”, or to a jump host on the way, needs a password or one-time code that Claude could not ask for on this connection. Most often the host’s key is simply not in your ~/.ssh/known_hosts yet: connect to it once with ssh in a terminal to record it, then try again. If you sign in to this host with an SSH key instead, no key could be used on this attempt: check the username in SSH host (user@host), and that the key is loaded in your agent or set under SSH key.": "登录“{host}”或途经的跳板机需要密码或一次性验证码，而 Claude 无法在此连接上向您询问。最常见的原因只是该主机的密钥尚未记录在您的 ~/.ssh/known_hosts 中：请先在终端中用 ssh 连接一次以记录它，然后再试。如果您改用 SSH 密钥登录此主机，则此次尝试无法使用任何密钥：请检查 SSH 主机中的用户名（user@host），以及密钥已加载到您的代理中或在 SSH 密钥下进行了设置。",
  "Signing in…": "正在登录…",
  "Signing out. Returning to your sign-in options…": "正在退出登录。正在返回登录选项…",
  "Signing secret": "签名密钥",
  "Signing you in…": "正在为你登录…",
  "Signpost": "路标",
  "Signs a JWT client assertion with this private key and exchanges it at the token URL for a short-lived access token (RFC 7523 §2.2).": "使用此私钥签署 JWT 客户端断言，并在令牌 URL 处交换为短期访问令牌（RFC 7523 §2.2）。",
  "Signs a JWT client assertion with this private key and exchanges it at the token URL for a short-lived access token (RFC 7523 §2.2). The private key is write-only and never shown after saving.": "使用此私钥对 JWT 客户端断言进行签名，并在令牌 URL 处将其换取短期访问令牌（RFC 7523 §2.2）。此私钥为只写，保存后不会再显示。",
  "Signs a JWT with this key and exchanges it at the token URL for a short-lived access token (RFC 7523). The private key is write-only and never shown after saving.": "用此密钥签发 JWT，并在 token URL 处将其换取一个短期访问 token（RFC 7523）。私钥为只写，保存后不再显示。",
  "Simple mechanism to test the onboarding flow. Archives all environments, disconnects GitHub, and redirects to onboarding. Sessions are untouched.": "用于测试引导流程的简单机制。归档所有环境、断开 GitHub 连接并重定向到引导页面。会话不受影响。",
  "Simplify daily tasks with Claude-created utility tools and practical applications. From helpful assistants and problem-solvers to everyday helpers and convenience tools, these utilities address common needs and challenges. Designed for real-world use, they make routine tasks easier and more efficient.": "利用 Claude 创建的实用工具和便捷应用，简化您的日常任务。从得力助手、问题解决工具到日常帮手和便利程序，这些工具旨在应对常见的需求和挑战。它们为实际使用而生，让日常事务处理更轻松、更高效。",
  "Simplify my method for outsiders": "把我的方法讲得让外行也能懂",
  "Simulate Rate Limits": "模拟频率限制",
  "Simulate rate limits": "模拟速率限制",
