  "Simulator touch surface — click to focus, then type to send keystrokes": "模拟器触控区域，点击以聚焦，然后输入以发送按键",
  "Simulator touch surface. Click to focus, then type to send keystrokes": "模拟器触控界面。点击以聚焦，然后输入以发送按键",
  "Since your current balance is lower than the minimum amount, your card will be automatically charged to bring your balance to {amount}, plus applicable taxes.": "由于您的当前余额低于最低金额，您的卡将被自动扣款，以将余额补足至 {amount}，外加适用的税费。",
