  "Single line, truncated on overflow. Maximum 200 characters.": "单行显示，超出部分会被截断。最多 200 个字符。",
  "Single member console": "单成员控制台",
  "Single sign-on": "单点登录 (SSO)",
  "Single sign-on (SSO)": "单点登录（SSO）",
  "Single sign-on (SSO) and domain capture": "单点登录 (SSO) 和域名捕获",
  "Single sign-on is required by your GitHub organization before Claude can access its repositories. Authorize on GitHub, then return here.": "你的 GitHub 组织要求先完成单点登录，Claude 才能访问其代码仓库。请在 GitHub 上授权，然后返回此处。",
  "Single sign-on is required by your GitHub organizations before Claude can access their repositories. When GitHub shows ‘Single sign-on to your organizations,’ click Authorize next to each one.": "您的 GitHub 组织要求在 Claude 访问其仓库之前进行单点登录。当 GitHub 显示“Single sign-on to your organizations”时，请依次点击每个组织旁边的 Authorize。",
  "Single sign-on is required by {orgNames} before Claude can access their repositories. Authorize on GitHub, then return here.": "{orgNames} 要求先完成单点登录，Claude 才能访问其存储库。请在 GitHub 上授权，然后返回此处。",
  "Single sign-on is required by {orgNames} before Claude can access their repositories. When GitHub shows ‘Single sign-on to your organizations,’ click Authorize next to each one.": "{orgNames} 要求在 Claude 访问其仓库之前进行单点登录。当 GitHub 显示“Single sign-on to your organizations”时，请依次点击每个组织旁边的 Authorize。",
  "Single sign-on is required for this provisioning mode; it is set up by the parent organization.": "此预配模式需要单点登录；它由上级组织设置。",
  "Site permissions": "网站权限",
  "Site reliability engineer": "站点可靠性工程师",
  "Site-level permissions are disabled for this site. You’ll be asked for each action.": "此站点的站点级权限已禁用。每次操作时都会询问您。",
  "Site-level permissions are inherited from the Chrome extension. <link>Manage permissions</link> in the Chrome extension settings to control which sites Claude can browse, click, and type on.": "站点级权限继承自 Chrome 扩展程序。可在 Chrome 扩展程序设置中<link>管理权限</link>，以控制 Claude 可以在哪些站点进行浏览、点击和输入。",
  "Sites Claude may not open, read, or act on in the built-in browser when the default site policy is allow. Users can still view them.": "当默认站点策略为允许时，Claude 不得在内置浏览器中打开、读取或操作的站点。用户仍可查看它们。",
  "Sites Claude may open, read, and act on in the built-in browser when the default site policy is block. Users can still view other sites.": "当默认站点策略为阻止时，Claude 可以在内置浏览器中打开、读取和操作的站点。用户仍可查看其他站点。",
  "Sites added here apply to this session only. Contact your admin to save them to your organization's allowlist.": "此处添加的站点仅适用于此会话。请联系您的管理员将它们保存到您组织的允许列表中。",
  "Sites added here apply to this task only. Change your Claude in Chrome settings to 'Block extension' to persist them.": "此处添加的站点仅适用于此任务。将您的 Claude in Chrome 设置更改为\"阻止扩展\"以保留它们。",
  "Sites blocked in your account's <link>Claude in Chrome settings</link> will stay blocked.": "在你的账号 <link>Claude in Chrome 设置</link> 中被屏蔽的网站将继续保持屏蔽状态。",
  "Sites blocked in your account’s <link>Claude in Chrome settings</link> will stay blocked.": "在您账户的 <link>Chrome 版 Claude 设置</link>中被屏蔽的站点会保持屏蔽状态。",
