  "Starting Conway…": "正在启动 Conway…",
  "Starting September 10, Claude can use its own browser inside the Cowork desktop app, with nothing for members to install. It’s off for your organization until then, when it turns on by default. Turn it on early or keep it off under Built-in browser in your Cowork settings. Claude in Chrome also turns on by default on September 10. If you’ve already turned Claude in Chrome off in Organization settings, that choice stays in place. It’ll only turn on for organizations that haven’t set a preference.": "从 9 月 10 日起，Claude 可以在 Cowork 桌面应用内使用自带的浏览器，成员无需安装任何东西。在此之前，该功能对您的组织处于关闭状态，届时将默认开启。您可以在 Cowork 设置的“内置浏览器”下提前开启或保持关闭。Claude in Chrome 也将于 9 月 10 日默认开启。如果您已在组织设置中关闭了 Claude in Chrome，该选择将继续保留。它只会在尚未设置偏好的组织中默认开启。",
