  "Starting {date} on desktop, chat and Cowork move from the side panel to the home screen, with a single message box and a toggle to switch between them. Org members choose which to use when starting a conversation, and projects and artifacts live together across both.": "自 {date} 起在桌面版中，聊天和 Cowork 从侧边栏移至主屏幕，提供一个统一的消息输入框和切换二者的开关。组织成员在开始对话时选择使用哪个，而项目和制品则同时存在于两者中。",
  "Starting {date} — Learn more": "自 {date} 起 — 了解更多",
  "Starting {date}, members of your organization on Claude desktop for Mac (Xcode required) can have Claude Code build their iOS app, launch the simulator, and verify the result without leaving the session. To keep this off, set the disableMobileSimulatorTools managed setting to true. No action is needed otherwise.": "从 {date} 起，您组织中使用 Claude 桌面版 for Mac（需要 Xcode）的成员可以让 Claude Code 构建他们的 iOS 应用、启动模拟器并验证结果，而无需离开会话。要保持关闭，请将 disableMobileSimulatorTools 托管设置设为 true。否则无需任何操作。",
  "Starting {date}, members of your organization with Claude Code Desktop can use Browser, which lets Claude view and interact with web pages in a side-by-side pane. If you’d prefer to keep this off, you can restrict it any time with the managed settings in the linked documentation. No action is needed otherwise.": "从 {date} 起，您组织中拥有 Claude Code Desktop 的成员可以使用浏览器功能，让 Claude 在并排窗格中查看并操作网页。如果您希望保持关闭，可随时通过链接文档中的托管设置进行限制。其他情况下无需任何操作。",
