  "Summarize a clinical paper": "总结一篇临床论文",
  "Summarize a clinical paper for me — population, intervention, outcome, and key caveats. I'll paste it below.": "帮我总结一篇临床论文——研究人群、干预措施、结局和关键注意事项。我会粘贴在下面。",
  "Summarize a clinical paper for me — population, intervention, outcome, and key caveats. I’ll paste it below.": "为我总结一篇临床论文——人群、干预、结局和关键注意事项。我会把它粘贴在下面。",
  "Summarize a contract": "总结一份合同",
  "Summarize a paper": "总结一篇论文",
  "Summarize and generate action items from feedback": "从反馈中总结并生成行动项目",
  "Summarize my academic papers": "总结我的学术论文",
  "Summarize my calendar and inbox for the day": "总结我今天的日历和收件箱信息",
  "Summarize my calendar and unread emails. Flag anything urgent.": "总结我的日历和未读邮件。标出所有紧急事项。",
  "Summarize my open PRs every weekday morning": "在每个工作日早晨总结我的待处理 PR",
  "Summarize my recent work in three sections: wins, blockers, and next steps. Keep the tone professional but not stiff...": "将我最近的工作按三个部分进行总结：进展、阻碍和后续步骤。保持语气专业但不呆板...",
  "Summarize my team’s recent Linear activity: what shipped, what slipped, what’s stuck in review — short enough to paste into standup, specific enough to be worth pasting.": "总结我团队最近的 Linear 活动：发布了什么、延期了什么、哪些卡在审核中——短到可以贴进站会，又具体到值得贴。",
  "Summarize my top projects this quarter": "总结本季度我的重点项目",
  "Summarize my week from my email and calendar: what I finished, what I left hanging, who’s still waiting on me. Then offer to make this my Friday afternoon ritual.": "根据我的邮件和日历总结我的一周：我完成了什么、留下了什么悬而未决、谁还在等我。然后提议把这变成我每周五下午的固定仪式。",
  "Summarize my week from my email: what I finished, what I left hanging, and who’s still waiting on me. Then offer to make this a Friday afternoon ritual.": "从我的邮件总结我这一周：完成了什么、搁置了什么，以及谁还在等我。然后提议把这件事变成每周五下午的固定流程。",
  "Summarize my week in Asana: completed, slipped, and newly added — plus whether my load for next week looks sane. Then offer to make this my Friday review ritual.": "总结我在 Asana 中的一周：已完成、已推迟和新增的——以及我下周的负荷是否合理。然后提议把这个变成我的周五回顾惯例。",
  "Summarize my week in HubSpot: deals moved, new contacts, pipeline added and lost, and how my quarter is tracking. Then offer to make this my Friday wrap-up.": "总结我本周在 HubSpot 的情况：推进的交易、新增的联系人、新增和流失的销售管道，以及本季度的进展。然后提议把这件事设为我的周五收尾任务。",
  "Summarize the SharePoint documents that were shared with me or changed recently, and tell me which ones are actually worth opening — with a one-line reason each. Save me the clicking.": "总结一下最近与我共享或发生变更的 SharePoint 文档，并告诉我哪些真正值得打开——每份附上一句理由。帮我省去点击的麻烦。",
  "Summarize the contract I'll paste below — key obligations, deadlines, and any red flags or unusual clauses.": "请总结我下面粘贴的合同——关键义务、截止日期，以及任何风险点或异常条款。",
  "Summarize the contract I’ll paste below — key obligations, deadlines, and any red flags or unusual clauses.": "请总结我将在下方粘贴的合同——关键义务、截止日期，以及任何危险信号或不寻常的条款。",
  "Summarize the week in my Linear team: closed, opened, carried over, and whether the cycle is on track. Then offer to send me this digest every Friday.": "总结我 Linear 团队这一周的情况：已关闭、新建、结转的任务，以及当前周期是否按计划进行。然后提出每周五给我发送这份摘要。",
  "Summarize this week across my Jira projects: closed, opened, still stuck, and the one risk worth raising. Then offer to send me this digest every Friday afternoon.": "总结我 Jira 项目中本周的情况：已关闭、已新建、仍然卡住的，以及一个值得上报的风险。然后提议每周五下午把这个摘要发给我。",
  "Summarize this week’s meetings: decisions, action items, and loose ends — the five-minute version of my whole week in rooms. Then offer to send me this digest every Friday.": "总结本周的会议：决定、待办事项和未了事项——我整个一周在会议室里的五分钟版本。然后主动提出每周五把这个摘要发给我。",
  "Summarize what changed across my Figma files this week: new files, active projects, and what seems to be converging or stalling. Then offer to send me this recap every Friday.": "总结本周我的 Figma 文件发生了什么变化：新文件、活跃项目，以及哪些看起来在收敛或停滞。然后提议每周五给我发送这份回顾。",
  "Summarize what changed across my bases this week: new records, edits, and which tables are growing. Then offer to send me this digest every Monday morning.": "总结我的各个数据库本周的变化：新记录、编辑，以及哪些表在增长。然后主动提出每周一早上把这个摘要发给我。",
  "Summarize what changed in my Notion workspace this week: pages created, pages edited, and anything that looks like it affects my work. Tell me the two changes most worth a closer look.": "总结一下本周我的 Notion 工作区发生了什么变化：新建的页面、编辑的页面，以及任何看起来会影响我工作的内容。告诉我最值得仔细查看的两项变化。",
  "Summarize what my team shipped recently from Jira: what closed, what slipped, and anything that looks stuck — written so I could paste it straight into standup or a stakeholder update.": "从 Jira 总结我团队最近交付的内容：哪些已关闭、哪些延期、哪些看起来卡住了——写得让我可以直接粘贴到站会或利益相关者更新中。",
  "Summarize what’s in my inbox today and flag the three emails that genuinely need my attention, with a one-line reason for each. Then tell me what can safely wait and what I can archive without reading.": "总结我今天的收件箱里有什么，并标出三封真正需要我关注的邮件，每封附上一句理由。然后告诉我哪些可以放心等待、哪些我可以不读就归档。",
