  "Syncing clears the tool names below and replaces the prompt names with your server’s current list ({prompts}). Changes are reviewed before going live.": "同步会清除下方的工具名称，并将提示名称替换为您服务器当前的列表（{prompts}）。更改在上线前会经过审查。",
