  "Syncing will <b>remove {removed, number} members</b> across orgs under {parentName}. Review carefully before continuing:": "同步将<b>移除 {parentName} 下各组织中的 {removed, number} 名成员</b>。请在继续之前仔细核对：",
  "Syncing will <b>remove {removed, number} members</b> across your organizations. Review carefully before continuing:": "同步将<b>移除您各组织中的 {removed, number} 位成员</b>。继续之前请仔细检查：",
