  "THIS IS A DEMO FEATURE. DO NOT SHARE SENSITIVE ANTHROPIC DATA OR CONFIDENTIAL INFORMATION.": "这是一个演示功能。切勿共享敏感的 ANTHROPIC 数据或机密信息。",
