  "TYPE": "类型",
  "Tab inserts indentation. Press Escape then Tab to move focus out of the editor.": "Tab 会插入缩进。按 Escape 然后按 Tab 可将焦点移出编辑器。",
  "Tab limit reached. Close a tab to open a new one.": "已达到标签页上限。请关闭一个标签页以打开新标签页。",
