  "Teach me skills by building one in front of me. Draft a small example now — turning rough notes into a tidy one-page summary — and show exactly what the skill captures: the steps, the format, the rules you’ll follow the same way every time. Then ask which task I actually repeat each week, rewrite the skill for that, and test it with me on one real example before saving it.": "通过在我面前实际构建一个技能来教我。现在草拟一个小例子——把粗略的笔记整理成一份简洁的一页摘要——并确切展示这个技能捕获了什么：步骤、格式，以及你每次都会以同样方式遵循的规则。然后问我每周实际重复的任务是什么，为此重写技能，并在保存前和我一起用一个真实例子测试它。",
