  "That URL points to <bold>{pastedHost}</bold>, not github.com. If it’s a GitHub Enterprise instance, configure it in <link>Claude Code settings</link> first.": "该 URL 指向 <bold>{pastedHost}</bold>，而不是 github.com。如果是 GitHub Enterprise 实例，请先在 <link>Claude Code 设置</link>中配置。",
  "That account isn't set up for API access. Choose an organization with API access in the Anthropic Console, or sign in to Claude.ai instead.": "该账户未设置 API 访问权限。请在 Anthropic Console 中选择一个具有 API 访问权限的组织，或改为登录 Claude.ai。",
  "That account isn’t set up for API access. Choose an organization with API access in the Claude Console, or sign in to Claude.ai instead.": "该账户未配置 API 访问权限。请在 Claude Console 中选择一个具有 API 访问权限的组织，或改为登录 Claude.ai。",
