  "That appears if you cancel on GitHub, wait more than a few minutes, or finish in a different tab or browser. Start again from this tab.": "如果您在 GitHub 上取消、等待超过几分钟，或在其他标签页或浏览器中完成，就会出现该情况。请从此标签页重新开始。",
