  "The <link>cloud environment</link> used in each thread": "每个线程中使用的<link>云环境</link>",
  "The AI for{br}problem solvers": "专为{br}问题解决者设计的 AI",
  "The Anthropic Interviewer will reach out once every 3 months for a 15-20 minute interview. Your participation is always optional.": "Anthropic 访谈员将每 3 个月进行一次 15-20 分钟的访谈。您的参与始终是可选的。",
  "The Authorization header is reserved for the access token. Use a different header name.": "Authorization 标头保留给访问令牌使用。请使用其他标头名称。",
  "The BAA also covers your use of the Anthropic API and Claude Code with ZDR (for qualifying organizations). Those services are configured separately. Contact your account team to enable HIPAA with other Eligible Services.": "BAA 还涵盖您对 Anthropic API 以及带 ZDR 的 Claude Code 的使用（适用于符合条件的组织）。这些服务需单独配置。请联系您的客户团队，以便对其他合格服务启用 HIPAA。",
  "The Claude Code GitHub App isn't installed on this repository. Install it to enable scanning.": "Claude Code GitHub App 未安装在此仓库上。安装它以启用扫描。",
  "The Claude Code GitHub App isn’t installed on this repository. Install it to enable scanning.": "此仓库未安装 Claude Code GitHub App。请先安装它再启用扫描。",
  "The Claude Code binary doesn't match this computer's architecture. Reinstall Claude Desktop for your platform.": "Claude Code 二进制文件与这台电脑的架构不匹配。请为你的平台重新安装 Claude Desktop。",
  "The Claude Code binary doesn’t match this computer’s architecture. Reinstall Claude Desktop for your platform.": "Claude Code 二进制文件与此电脑的架构不匹配。请为您的平台重新安装 Claude Desktop。",
  "The Claude Code binary is missing or damaged. Reinstall Claude Desktop to continue.": "Claude Code 二进制文件缺失或已损坏。请重新安装 Claude Desktop 以继续。",
  "The Claude Code binary on {target} is missing. Send your message again to redeploy it.": "{target} 上的 Claude Code 二进制文件缺失。请再次发送您的消息以重新部署。",
  "The Claude GitHub App has a pending permission request. An owner needs to approve it on GitHub.": "Claude GitHub App 有一个待处理的权限请求。需要所有者在 GitHub 上批准。",
  "The Claude GitHub App hasn’t been verified on your repositories yet.": "Claude GitHub App 尚未在您的仓库上完成验证。",
  "The Claude GitHub App is no longer installed on this repository. <link>Install the GitHub App</link> and try again.": "Claude GitHub App 已不再安装在此代码库上。<link>安装 GitHub App</link>并重试。",
  "The Claude GitHub App is not installed on <bold>{repo}</bold>. <link>Install the GitHub App</link> and try again.": "Claude GitHub App 未安装在此仓库 <bold>{repo}</bold> 上。<link>安装 GitHub App</link> 后重试。",
  "The Claude GitHub App isn't installed on this repository, so it can't be scanned. Click to recheck.": "此代码库未安装 Claude GitHub App，因此无法扫描。点击重新检查。",
  "The Claude GitHub App isn't installed on this repository. Install it to run a scan.": "此仓库未安装 Claude GitHub App。请安装它以运行扫描。",
  "The Claude GitHub App isn’t installed on this repository, so it can’t be scanned. Click to recheck.": "此仓库未安装 Claude GitHub App，因此无法扫描。点击以重新检查。",
  "The Claude GitHub App isn’t installed on this repository. Install it to run a scan.": "此仓库未安装 Claude GitHub App。请先安装它再运行扫描。",
  "The Claude GitHub App isn’t installed on {upstreamOwner}. <link>Open the PR on GitHub</link> instead.": "未在 {upstreamOwner} 上安装 Claude GitHub App。请改为<link>在 GitHub 上打开该拉取请求</link>。",
  "The Claude GitHub App isn’t installed.": "Claude GitHub App 未安装。",
  "The Claude GitHub App isn’t visible from your connected GitHub account @{login}. Make sure that account is a member of the GitHub organization where the App is installed.": "从您连接的 GitHub 账户 @{login} 看不到 Claude GitHub App。请确保该账户是已安装该 App 的 GitHub 组织的成员。",
  "The Claude GitHub App isn’t visible from your connected GitHub account. Make sure that account is a member of the GitHub organization where the App is installed.": "从您连接的 GitHub 账户看不到 Claude GitHub App。请确保该账户是已安装该 App 的 GitHub 组织的成员。",
  "The Claude GitHub App may not be installed there yet. <a>Add a GitHub installation</a>.": "Claude GitHub App 可能尚未安装到那里。<a>添加一个 GitHub 安装</a>。",
  "The Claude GitHub App may not have access to it yet. Ask a {orgName} admin to add it on the <a>installation settings page</a>. If you recently requested access, it may still be awaiting admin approval.": "Claude GitHub App 可能还没有访问它的权限。请让 {orgName} 管理员在<a>安装设置页面</a>上添加它。如果您最近申请了访问权限，可能仍在等待管理员批准。",
  "The Claude GitHub App needs to be reconnected so Claude can work with your repositories.": "需要重新连接 Claude GitHub App，Claude 才能使用您的仓库。",
  "The Claude GitHub App needs to be reconnected.": "Claude GitHub App 需要重新连接。",
  "The Claude GitHub App needs updated permissions to create webhooks.": "Claude GitHub App 需要更新权限才能创建 webhook。",
  "The Claude Security spend limit for your organization has been reached.": "您组织的 Claude Security 消费限额已达到。",
  "The Claude app is installed on these GitHub accounts, but they aren’t linked to this workspace yet.": "这些 GitHub 账户上已安装 Claude 应用，但它们尚未链接到此工作区。",
  "The Claude app is installed on these GitHub accounts. Link one to give this workspace access to its repositories.": "Claude 应用已安装在这些 GitHub 账户上。请关联其中一个，让此工作区可以访问其仓库。",
  "The Claude app on {login} has a pending permission request. Accept it on GitHub, then come back to link.": "{login} 上的 Claude 应用有一个待处理的权限请求。请先在 GitHub 上接受，然后再回来关联。",
  "The Claude app was uninstalled on GitHub for {login}.": "GitHub 上已为 {login} 卸载了 Claude 应用。",
  "The Claude window will hide. A tooltip appears next to each step with a Next button. Click Exit anytime to stop.": "Claude 窗口将隐藏。每个步骤旁会出现一个带有“下一步”按钮的工具提示。随时点击“退出”即可停止。",
  "The Client ID from your Canvas LTI app registration (found in Canvas Admin > Developer Keys)": "来自您的 Canvas LTI 应用注册的客户端 ID（位于 Canvas 管理员 > 开发者密钥中）",
  "The Client ID from your Canvas app registration": "来自您的 Canvas 应用注册的客户端 ID",
