  "This artifact’s access to Claude is disabled for your organization. Contact your administrator to enable it.": "您的组织已禁用此制品对 Claude 的访问权限。请联系您的管理员以启用它。",
  "This artifact’s folder is missing on disk. It may have been moved or deleted outside of Claude.": "此制品的文件夹在磁盘上缺失。它可能在 Claude 之外被移动或删除。",
