  "This marketplace is already included by default. (see “By {name}”)": "此市场已默认包含。（见“由 {name} 提供”）",
  "This marketplace is part of Claude's default set. If it's not showing in your list, it may need to be enabled in your workspace settings.": "此市场是 Claude 默认集的一部分。如果它未显示在你的列表中，可能需要在你的工作区设置中启用。",
  "This marketplace is part of Claude’s default set. If it’s not showing in your list, it may need to be enabled in your workspace settings.": "此市场是 Claude 默认集合的一部分。如果它未显示在您的列表中，可能需要在您的工作区设置中启用。",
  "This marketplace isn’t on your organization’s approved list. Contact your administrator to get it approved.": "此市场不在您组织的批准列表中。请联系您的管理员使其获得批准。",
  "This marketplace uses a reserved name and can't be added.": "此市场使用保留名称，无法添加。",
  "This marketplace uses a reserved name and can’t be added.": "此市场使用了保留名称，无法添加。",
  "This may be a custom connector you don’t have.": "这可能是您尚未拥有的自定义连接器。",
  "This may be because of network issues. You can try reloading the page.": "这可能是因为网络问题。您可以尝试重新加载页面。",
  "This may open your browser to finish signing in. It can take a moment.": "这可能会打开你的浏览器以完成登录。可能需要稍等片刻。",
