  "Turn a pile of user feedback into a decision table: generate thirty realistic feedback snippets for a fictional app, then extract the table — theme, count, severity, representative quote, suggested next step. Then I’ll paste my real feedback and you do it again.": "把一堆用户反馈转成决策表：先为一个虚构应用生成 30 条真实的反馈片段，然后提取表格——主题、数量、严重程度、代表性引述、建议的下一步。然后我会粘贴我的真实反馈，你再做一次。",
