  "Turn on the Claude in Chrome connector": "开启 Claude in Chrome 连接器",
  "Turn on the GitHub integration for this workspace, then connect your account to see organizations you can link.": "为此工作区开启 GitHub 集成，然后连接您的账户，即可看到可关联的组织。",
  "Turn on usage credits": "开启用量额度",
  "Turn on usage credits in Settings → Usage to let them run": "在“设置 → 用量”中开启用量额度，以便让它们运行",
  "Turn on usage credits to keep going · Limit resets {time}": "开启用量积分以继续使用 · 限额将在 {time} 重置",
  "Turn on usage credits to keep using Claude if you hit a limit. <link>Learn more</link>": "开启用量额度，以便在达到限额时继续使用 Claude。<link>了解更多</link>",
  "Turn on usage credits to keep using Claude if you hit a plan limit. <link>Learn more</link>": "若达到套餐限制，开启用量积分即可继续使用 Claude。<link>了解更多</link>",
  "Turn on usage credits to keep working": "开启用量额度以继续工作",
  "Turn on usage credits to keep working after you hit your plan limit. Credits are billed separately from your plan — see our <link>Help Center article</link>.": "达到套餐限制后，开启用量积分即可继续工作。积分与您的套餐分开计费——请参阅我们的<link>帮助中心文章</link>。",
  "Turn on usage credits to keep working past your plan limit.": "开启用量额度，以便超过计划限额后继续工作。",
  "Turn on usage credits?": "开启用量积分？",
  "Turn on web search": "开启网络搜索",
  "Turn on web search for your team members.": "为您团队成员开启网页搜索。",
  "Turn on web search in Search and tools menu. Otherwise, links provided may not be accurate or up to date.": "在“搜索与工具”菜单中开启网页搜索。否则，提供的链接可能不准确或由于版本陈旧。",
  "Turn on {extraUsageLink} for additional runs.": "开启 {extraUsageLink} 以获得额外的运行次数。",
  "Turn on “{name}”": "开启“{name}”",
  "Turn open-text survey comments into something leadership can act on: generate forty realistic engagement-survey comments, then extract the table — theme, count, representative quote, and suggested owner. Then I’ll paste ours and you produce the same table.": "把开放式调查评论转成领导层可执行的内容：先生成 40 条真实的参与度调查评论，然后提取表格——主题、数量、代表性引述和建议负责人。之后我会贴上我们的内容，你再给出同样的表格。",
  "Turn raw logs into a clean table": "将原始日志转换为整洁的表格",
  "Turn raw text into a labeled dataset": "将原始文本转换为带标签的数据集",
  "Turn readings into summaries and notes into study guides.": "将读物转化为摘要，将笔记转化为学习指南。",
  "Turn skills on or off for everyone in your organization, including admin-managed organization skills.": "为组织中的所有人开启或关闭技能，包括管理员管理的组织技能。",
  "Turn skills on or off for everyone in your organization, including admin-managed organization skills. Requires 'Code execution and file creation' to be enabled to use.": "为组织中的每个人开启或关闭技能，包括管理员管理的组织技能。需要启用“代码执行和文件创建”才能使用。",
  "Turn skills on or off for your workspace, including admin-managed skills.": "为您的工作区开启或关闭技能，包括管理员管理的技能。",
  "Turn survey comments into themes": "把调查评论归纳成主题",
  "Turn these receipts into an expense report": "将这些收据转化为报销单",
