  "Turning Claude on or off from this page isn’t enabled yet. No changes were saved.": "尚未启用在此页面打开或关闭 Claude。没有保存任何变更。",
  "Turning ON the improve Claude setting extends data retention from 30 days to 5 years to improve our model performance and safety. Turning it OFF keeps the default 30-day data retention. Delete data anytime.": "开启“改进 Claude ”设置会将数据保留期从 30 天延长到 5 年，以提高我们的模型性能和安全性。关闭它则保持默认的 30 天数据保留期。可以随时删除数据。",
  "Turning off extra usage will immediately prevent all members from using Claude beyond their base subscription limits. Any ongoing conversations may be interrupted.": "关闭额外用量将立即阻止所有成员使用超出其基础订阅限制的 Claude。任何正在进行的对话都可能中断。",
  "Turning off extra usage will immediately prevent you from using Claude beyond your base subscription limits. Any ongoing conversations may be interrupted.": "关闭额外用量将立即阻止您使用超出基础订阅限额的 Claude。任何正在进行的对话都可能中断。",
  "Turning off {feature} will also make {dependents} unavailable.": "关闭 {feature} 也会使 {dependents} 不可用。",
  "Turning on…": "正在开启……",
  "Turning over": "正在重置",
  "Turning this off also changes related settings, so it’s done on its settings page.": "关闭此项还会更改相关设置，因此需在其设置页面上完成。",
  "Turning this on enables Memory for your account — Claude saves what you shared here and remembers it across conversations. You can manage or turn off Memory anytime in Settings.": "开启后将为您的账户启用记忆功能——Claude 会保存您在此分享的内容，并在后续对话中记住它。您可以随时在设置中管理或关闭记忆。",
  "Turning this on enables memory for your account: I remember what I learn across conversations, so you never start from scratch. You can manage or turn off memory anytime in Settings.": "开启后即为您的账户启用记忆：我会记住在不同对话中学到的东西，让您不必每次从零开始。您可以随时在设置中管理或关闭记忆。",
  "Turns the banner on. When false or unset, the other banner fields are ignored.": "开启该横幅。为 false 或未设置时，其他横幅字段将被忽略。",
