  "Two separate rules apply to a member. First, their spend limit caps what they can spend. With more than one group, the Member limit from groups setting picks the group limit. Second, Pooled budget priority only picks which pool pays for the spend.": "成员受两条独立规则的约束。第一，他们的支出限额限制其可支出的金额。当属于多个群组时，“来自群组的成员限额”设置决定采用哪个群组限额。第二，“共享额度池优先级”只决定由哪个额度池为该支出付费。",
