  "Waiting for you: {host} needs you to confirm it’s you (security key or browser sign-in).": "等待您操作：{host} 需要您确认身份（安全密钥或浏览器登录）。",
  "Waiting for you: {host} needs you to sign in before this can be sent. Claude will ask as soon as you’re back.": "等待您操作：{host} 需要您先登录才能发送。您一回来 Claude 就会询问。",
  "Waiting for you: {host} needs you to sign in. Claude will ask as soon as you’re back.": "等待您操作：{host} 需要您登录。您一回来 Claude 就会提示。",
  "Waiting for you: {host} wouldn’t take a key from this computer yet (is your SSH agent locked?). Claude will try again as soon as that changes or you’re back.": "等待您处理：{host} 暂不接受来自这台电脑的密钥（您的 SSH 代理是否被锁定？）。情况一有变化或您一回来，Claude 就会立即重试。",
