  "Wake up to a briefing that’s already written": "醒来就能看到一份已写好的简报",
  "Walk away with a deck you can share": "带走一份可向他人展示的演示文稿",
  "Walk me through a bank reconciliation using a fictional example: invent a short bank statement and ledger with a timing difference, a duplicate charge, and a missing fee, then reconcile them step by step in a clear table showing matched, unmatched, and adjusted rows.": "用一个虚构的例子带我走一遍银行对账：构思一份简短的银行对账单和分类账，包含一处时间性差异、一笔重复扣款和一笔遗漏的手续费，然后在一张清晰的表格中逐步对账，标出已匹配、未匹配和已调整的行。",
  "Walk me through a framework for diagnosing and improving ML model performance.": "带我了解一个用于诊断和提升机器学习模型性能的框架。",
  "Walk me through a full analysis": "带我走一遍完整分析",
  "Walk me through a hard problem": "带我解决一个难题",
  "Walk me through a review of my lost deals: ask about the last three I lost, one at a time — what happened, when it stalled, what they said. Then show me the pattern I can’t see from inside: where my deals actually die and the one change to make before my next call.": "带我回顾我丢失的交易：一次一个地问我最近丢失的三笔——发生了什么、何时停滞、对方说了什么。然后向我展示我从内部看不到的模式：我的交易实际上死在哪里，以及下次通话前要做出的一项改动。",
  "Walk me through a valuation": "带我走一遍估值",
  "Walk me through connecting Slack, then show me what I’ve missed: summarize my unread threads and DMs, rank the five that most need a reply from me today and say why, and draft a reply to the top one so I can review, edit, and send it myself.": "带我完成 Slack 的连接，然后向我展示我错过了什么：总结我的未读帖文和私信，排出今天最需要我回复的五条并说明原因，并为最重要的那条草拟一份回复，好让我审阅、编辑并自行发送。",
  "Walk me through debugging a small Python data pipeline in chat: write one with three hidden bugs — a silent type coercion, a timezone shift, and a join that silently drops rows — then narrate exactly how you’d catch each one methodically. No files needed.": "在聊天中带我调试一个小型 Python 数据管道：写一个包含三个隐藏 bug 的管道——一个静默的类型转换、一个时区偏移，以及一个会静默丢弃行的连接——然后准确叙述你会如何有条不紊地捕获每一个 bug。无需任何文件。",
  "Walk me through how to choose the right chart for a data science result.": "带我了解如何为数据科学结果选择合适的图表。",
  "Walk me through how to read financial statements — what the income statement, balance sheet, and cash flow statement each tell you, using one simple company example traced across all three.": "带我了解如何阅读财务报表——损益表、资产负债表和现金流量表各自说明了什么，用一个简单的公司例子贯穿三张表来讲解。",
  "Walk me through my day": "带我回顾我今天的一天",
  "Walk me through my day: each meeting, the gaps between them, and what I should prepare before each one. Tell me where my real focus time is hiding and what I’d have to move to protect it.": "带我走一遍我的一天：每个会议、它们之间的空隙，以及我应该在每一个之前准备什么。告诉我我真正的专注时间藏在哪里，以及我必须挪动什么来保护它。",
  "Walk me through my statistics": "带我解读我的统计数据",
  "Walk me through the main marketing attribution models — first-touch, last-touch, linear, time-decay — and when each one makes sense.": "带我了解主要的营销归因模型，包括首次触达、最后触达、线性和时间衰减，以及各自适用的场景。",
  "Walk me through the most useful consulting frameworks — MECE, issue trees, hypothesis-driven problem solving — and when to reach for each.": "带我了解最有用的咨询框架，如 MECE、问题树、假设驱动的问题解决，以及分别适合在什么情况下使用。",
  "Walk me through the statistics: generate a small realistic dataset for a two-group study, choose the right test and say why, run it, and interpret the result the way a reviewer would read it. Then I’ll describe my data and we pick my test together.": "带我走一遍统计分析：为一项两组研究生成一份小型但真实的数据集，选择合适的检验方法并说明原因，运行检验，并以审稿人的视角解读结果。然后我会描述我的数据，我们一起为我选择合适的检验方法。",
  "Walk me through today": "带我回顾今天",
  "Walk through in diff": "在 diff 中逐步查看",
  "Wander through an endless Japanese tea garden where cherry blossoms bloom eternal": "漫步于樱花永久盛开的无尽日式茶馆花园",
  "Want an API key?": "想要 API 密钥吗？",
  "Want more visuals? Try phrases like “visualize this” or “show me.”": "想要更多可视化内容？试试“可视化这段内容”或“展示给我看”之类的说法。",
  "Want this every morning? Claude can run it on a schedule.": "想每天早上都看到这个吗？Claude 可以按计划运行它。",
