  "We couldn’t confirm <b>{branch}</b> is on GitHub. If it’s not, the cloud session may fail to start.": "我们无法确认 <b>{branch}</b> 已在 GitHub 上。如果没有，云端会话可能无法启动。",
  "We couldn’t confirm that this verification link is valid for your signup. Check the link and the account you’re applying with.": "我们无法确认此验证链接对您的注册是否有效。请检查链接以及您用来申请的账户。",
  "We couldn’t confirm whether the payment went through — checking…": "我们无法确认付款是否成功——正在检查…",
