  "We couldn’t confirm your organization’s policy for this setting, so it can’t be changed right now. Reload the page to try again.": "我们无法确认您的组织对此设置的策略，因此目前无法更改。请刷新页面重试。",
  "We couldn’t confirm {card} as your default. Check it under Payment.": "我们无法确认 {card} 为您的默认付款方式。请在“付款”下查看。",
