  "We couldn’t find a completed nonprofit verification for your email address. You can still create a Team plan at standard pricing.": "我们未能找到针对您电子邮件地址的已完成非营利组织验证。您仍可按标准定价创建 Team 套餐。",
  "We couldn’t find that export any more. Start it again.": "我们再也找不到该导出文件。请重新开始。",
  "We couldn’t find your account information": "我们找不到您的账户信息",
  "We couldn’t finish signing you in": "我们无法完成您的登录",
  "We couldn’t finish your refund": "我们无法完成您的退款",
  "We couldn’t load pricing": "我们无法加载价格",
  "We couldn’t load pricing. Check your connection and try again.": "我们无法加载价格。请检查您的连接并重试。",
