  "We’ll add {amount} in credits to their account": "我们会向他们的账户添加 {amount} 额度",
  "We’ll also refund {amount} (plus tax) of unused usage credits.": "我们还会退还 {amount}（含税）的未使用用量积分。",
  "We’ll email you 3 days before it ends": "我们会在它结束前 3 天发邮件给您",
  "We’ll email you after we review this organization.": "我们审核完此组织后会给您发邮件。",
  "We’ll email you after we review your account. Until then, you won’t be able to use Claude, but you can come back to this page to check the status.": "我们会在审核您的账户后给您发送电子邮件。在此之前，您将无法使用 Claude，但您可以随时回到此页面查看状态。",
  "We’ll email you once we’ve reached a decision. Review decisions are final.": "一旦我们做出决定，就会给您发送邮件。复核决定为最终决定。",
  "We’ll email you the outcome": "我们会把结果通过邮件通知您",
  "We’ll email {email} after we review your account. Until then, you won’t be able to use Claude, but you can come back to this page to check the status.": "我们会在审核您的账户后向 {email} 发送邮件。在此之前，您将无法使用 Claude，但您可以回到此页面查看状态。",
  "We’ll email {name}’s gift to {toEmail} on {date}. You’ll also get a confirmation at {fromEmail}.": "我们会在 {date} 把 {name} 的礼品发送到 {toEmail}。您也会在 {fromEmail} 收到一封确认邮件。",
  "We’ll hand you off to our verification partner to complete this securely.": "我们会将您转交给我们的验证合作伙伴以安全地完成此操作。",
  "We’ll notify affected users. They’ll have {days} days to migrate. For anyone who doesn’t migrate, we’ll email their data and then delete their account. Console organizations and API access are not affected.": "我们将通知受影响的用户。他们将有 {days} 天的时间进行迁移。对于未迁移的任何人，我们会将其数据通过电子邮件发送给他们，然后删除其账户。Console 组织和 API 访问不受影响。",
  "We’ll package up your account information for download. This might take some time to complete.": "我们会将您的账户信息打包以供下载。这可能需要一些时间才能完成。",
  "We’ll package up your conversations, projects, and settings for download. This might take some time to complete.": "我们会将您的对话、项目和设置打包以供下载。这可能需要一些时间才能完成。",
  "We’ll put this toward your next invoice.": "我们会将这笔金额计入你的下一张发票。",
  "We’ll put this toward your next {invoice} invoice.": "我们会将这笔金额计入你的下一张 {invoice} 发票。",
  "We’ll redirect you to your GitHub Enterprise instance to create a pre-configured App with one click. You won’t need to enter credentials manually.": "我们会将您重定向到您的 GitHub Enterprise 实例，一键创建预配置的 App。您无需手动输入凭据。",
  "We’ll refund the unused part of this billing period to {destination}": "我们会把这个计费周期内未使用的部分退款到 {destination}",
  "We’ll refund {amount} (plus tax) of unused usage credits.": "我们将退还 {amount}（含税）的未使用用量积分。",
  "We’ll review your account": "我们将审核您的账户",
  "We’ll send a reminder when your free trial is ending.": "当您的免费试用即将结束时，我们会发送提醒。",
  "We’ll send a reminder when your trial is ending.": "我们将在试用即将结束时发送提醒。",
  "We’ll send an email and a nudge inviting them to try Claude Code and Cowork.": "我们将发送一封电子邮件和一条提醒，邀请他们试用 Claude Code 和 Cowork。",
  "We’ll send an email inviting them to try Claude Code and Cowork.": "我们将发送一封电子邮件，邀请他们试用 Claude Code 和 Cowork。",
  "We’ll send it to the address you gave us.": "我们会将其发送到您提供的地址。",
  "We’ll send it to {email}.": "我们会将它发送到 {email}。",
  "We’ll top up to {reloadTo} when your balance drops below {threshold}.": "当您的余额低于 {threshold} 时，我们会充值至 {reloadTo}。",
  "We’ll use this contact for any questions about your submission.": "如有任何关于您提交内容的问题，我们将使用此联系方式。",
  "We’ll use this to verify your account": "我们会使用此项来验证您的账号",
  "We’re <link>working on it</link> — try again in a moment.": "我们正在 <link>处理</link>——请稍后重试。",
  "We’re confirming your eligibility": "我们正在确认您的资格",
  "We’re currently focused on learning from Max plan users during this beta phase. As we improve safety and reliability based on real usage, we’ll gradually expand to other plans. We don’t have a specific timeline to share yet, but expanding access is a priority.": "在此 Beta 阶段，我们当前的重点是从 Max 套餐用户处学习。我们会根据真实使用情况改进安全性和可靠性，然后逐步扩展到其他套餐。我们目前还没有具体的时间表，但扩大访问范围是我们的优先事项。",
  "We’re experiencing high demand. Check back soon to claim. Don’t worry, your credit’s reserved until {date}.": "目前需求旺盛。请稍后再来领取。别担心，您的积分会保留至 {date}。",
  "We’re having trouble reaching this connector right now. Please try again.": "我们目前无法连接到此连接器。请重试。",
  "We’re having trouble verifying your sign-in. Retrying now.": "我们在验证您的登录时遇到问题。正在重试。",
  "We’re moving your account to {orgName}. This will take a couple minutes, and we’ll sign you out when it’s done. Just sign back in to get started.": "我们正在将您的账户迁移到 {orgName}。这需要几分钟时间，完成后我们会将您登出。只需重新登录即可开始。",
  "We’re not quite ready yet": "我们还没准备好",
  "We’re reviewing your application. You’ll receive an email when it’s processed, usually within 1–2 business days.": "我们正在审核您的申请。处理完成后您会收到邮件，通常需要 1–2 个工作日。",
  "We’re rolling out access to the browser extension gradually. Join the waitlist and we’ll let you know as soon as it’s your turn!": "我们正在逐步开放浏览器扩展的使用权限。加入等待队列，轮到您时我们会立即通知您！",
  "We’re sorry to see you go! If you have time - your feedback helps us improve the product.": "很遗憾看到您离开！如果您有时间——您的反馈有助于我们改进产品。",
  "We’re sorry, <bold>{clientName}</bold> connections are only available for Claude.ai paid accounts": "抱歉，<bold>{clientName}</bold> 连接仅适用于 Claude.ai 付费账号",
  "We’re starting a unit on fractions. About a third of the class reads below grade level, and several students need extra reading support.": "我们即将开始分数单元。班里大约三分之一的学生阅读水平低于年级标准，还有几名学生需要额外的阅读辅导。",
  "We’re still trying to confirm your payment: you’ll get an email if it is successfully processed.": "我们仍在确认您的付款：处理成功后您将收到一封邮件。",
  "We’re working hard to bring the artifacts space to Teams and Enterprises.": "我们正努力将构件 (Artifacts) 空间带给团队和企业版用户。",
