  "Will run in the cloud only — this conversation isn’t tied to a computer.": "将仅在云端运行 — 此对话未关联到任何电脑。",
  "Will run in the cloud only. To let it use a computer, approve from the Claude desktop app on that computer.": "将仅在云端运行。如要让 Claude 使用某台电脑，请从该电脑上的 Claude 桌面应用中进行批准。",
