  "Windows compressed the folder holding the workspace’s virtual disk, and virtualization can’t open a compressed disk. Reinstalling won’t fix it — the new files inherit the same setting. The details below describe how to check and what to change.": "Windows 压缩了存放工作区虚拟磁盘的文件夹，而虚拟化无法打开压缩过的磁盘。重新安装也无法修复——新文件会继承相同的设置。下方详情描述了如何检查以及如何更改。",
  "Windows has compressed Claude’s workspace disk": "Windows 已压缩 Claude 的工作区磁盘",
  "Windows is blocking access to Claude’s workspace disk": "Windows 正在阻止访问 Claude 的工作区磁盘",
  "Windows limits a process’s starting folder to 260 characters. Open this project from a shorter path to start a session.": "Windows 将进程的起始文件夹限制为 260 个字符。请从较短的路径打开此项目以启动会话。",
  "Windows on Arm not currently supported": "Arm 架构的 Windows 目前暂不支持",
