  "Without Pro, you’ll lose access to these advanced features:": "没有 Pro，您将失去这些高级功能：",
  "Without a filter, the routine fires on every matching event.": "如果没有筛选器，例程将在每个匹配事件上触发。",
  "Without code execution, Claude can't analyze spreadsheets or other files that require computation in Chat.": "如果没有代码执行，Claude 无法在聊天中分析电子表格或其他需要计算的文件。",
  "Without credentials, anyone with access to the server URL will be able to use this connector.": "如果没有凭据，任何可以访问此服务器 URL 的人都能使用此连接器。",
  "Without credentials, anyone with access to the server URL will be able to use this connector. If the server uses an API key instead of OAuth, add it as a request header below.": "如果没有凭据，任何能访问服务器 URL 的人都可以使用此连接器。如果服务器使用 API 密钥而不是 OAuth，请在下方将其添加为请求头。",
  "Without credentials, anyone with access to the server URL will be able to use this connector. If the server uses an API key instead of OAuth, add it as a request header on the next step.": "如果没有凭据，任何能访问服务器 URL 的人都可以使用此连接器。如果服务器使用 API 密钥而非 OAuth，请在下一步将其添加为请求标头。",
