  "Write a technical spec for a feature I’ll describe in one sentence. Include system context, API changes, data model, edge cases, and rollout plan — mark every assumption so engineers can correct fast. I’ll describe the feature now:": "为我会用一句话描述的功能编写技术规格。包括系统上下文、API 变更、数据模型、边界情况和上线计划——标注每条假设，以便工程师快速纠正。我现在描述这个功能：",
  "Write a video script that sounds spoken, not written — a three-minute explainer on a topic I name, or demo one on why sourdough needs time: the hook in the first eight seconds, cut points marked, and B-roll suggestions next to each beat.": "写一份听起来像口语而非书面语的视频脚本——针对我指定主题的三分钟讲解，或者以“为什么酸面团需要时间”为例进行演示：前八秒的钩子、标注切换点，并在每个节奏旁给出 B-roll 建议。",
