  "Write developer handoff notes for my latest Figma design: components, spacing, colors, and intended behavior, organized screen by screen — the doc a developer would otherwise ping me for.": "为我最新的 Figma 设计编写开发者交接说明：组件、间距、颜色和预期行为，按屏幕组织——也就是开发者本来会来问我的那份文档。",
  "Write down what’s weighing on you, then let it go.": "写下让你烦心的事，然后放下它们。",
  "Write event descriptions": "编写活动描述",
  "Write executive summaries": "撰写执行摘要",
  "Write grant proposals": "编写拨款提案",
  "Write marketing copy": "编写营销文案",
  "Write microcopy for a UI": "为 UI 撰写微文案",
  "Write microcopy for a UI element I'll describe — buttons, empty states, error messages. Ask what tone fits our product.": "为我将描述的 UI 元素编写微文案，例如按钮、空状态、错误消息。先问什么语气适合我们的产品。",
  "Write microcopy for a UI element I’ll describe — buttons, empty states, error messages. Ask what tone fits our product.": "为我会描述的某个 UI 元素撰写文案——按钮、空状态、错误信息。先问问什么语气适合我们的产品。",
  "Write my abstract by interviewing me — five questions about what I did and what I found, then a structured 250-word draft, plus a one-sentence version for a general audience.": "通过采访我来写我的摘要——问我五个关于我做了什么和我发现了什么的问题，然后给出一篇结构化的 250 字草稿，外加一句面向普通受众的版本。",
  "Write my abstract with me": "和我一起写摘要",
  "Write my dev handoff notes": "撰写我的开发交付说明",
  "Write my status update": "写我的状态更新",
  "Write my status update from my Linear activity this week: done, doing, blocked — in plain language, no ticket IDs in the prose, links at the end. Ready to paste.": "根据我本周的 Linear 活动写一份状态更新：已完成、进行中、被阻塞——用平实的语言，正文中不含工单 ID，链接放在末尾。可以直接粘贴。",
  "Write my status update from my recent Jira activity: what I finished, what’s in progress, what’s blocked and why. Plain language my manager would actually read, not ticket-speak.": "根据我最近的 Jira 活动写一份状态更新：完成了什么、进行中的是什么、什么被阻塞以及为什么。用我经理真的会读的平实语言，而不是工单腔。",
  "Write my study design one-pager": "写我的研究设计一页纸",
  "Write my three-touch outreach sequence": "撰写我的三次触达外联序列",
  "Write my video script": "撰写我的视频脚本",
  "Write my weekly exec revenue update — top-line trend, key drivers, charts, and what to watch — for me to review before I send it. Pull the data from my connected tools. If you're missing a source, ask before building.": "为我撰写每周高管营收更新——总体趋势、关键驱动因素、图表以及需要关注的事项——供我在发送前审阅。从我已连接的工具中获取数据。如果缺少某个数据源，请在构建前询问。",
  "Write my weekly marketing review": "撰写我的每周营销回顾",
  "Write my weekly marketing review — pipeline vs goal, engagement by segment, biggest gaps, what to watch — for me to review before I post it. Pull the data from my connected tools. If you're missing a source, ask before building.": "撰写我的每周营销回顾——管道对比目标、按细分群体的互动情况、最大的差距、需要关注的要点——供我在发布前审阅。从我已连接的工具中提取数据。如果缺少来源，请在构建前询问。",
  "Write my weekly stakeholder update — what shipped, what we learned, what's next, and what to watch — for me to review before I post it. Pull the data from my connected tools. If you're missing a source, ask before building.": "为我撰写每周利益相关者更新——交付了什么、我们学到了什么、下一步是什么、需要关注什么——供我在发布前审阅。从我已连接的工具中获取数据。如果缺少某个数据源，请在构建前询问。",
  "Write my weekly status update from my own Slack activity: what I shipped, decided, unblocked, and discussed. Plain language, three short sections, ready to paste wherever my team posts updates.": "根据我自己的 Slack 活动撰写本周状态更新：我交付了什么、做了什么决定、解除了什么阻塞、讨论了什么。用平实的语言，分三个简短部分，可以直接粘贴到团队发布更新的任何地方。",
  "Write out a folder structure for a mid-size design-build project — drawings, calculations, vendor docs, site photos — with a revision naming convention that handles Rev C and beyond, plus one rule that prevents duplicate copies from spreading. Show it as a plain text tree I can copy.": "为一个中型设计-建造项目编写文件夹结构——图纸、计算书、供应商文档、现场照片——并配有一套能处理 Rev C 及之后版本的修订命名规范，再加一条防止副本四处扩散的规则。以纯文本树形结构展示，方便我复制。",
