  "Xcode and Simulator installed": "已安装 Xcode 和模拟器",
  "Xcode command-line tools selected, but the Claude Code iOS Simulator needs a full Xcode install. Install Xcode, then run `sudo xcode-select -s /Applications/Xcode.app/Contents/Developer`.": "已选择 Xcode 命令行工具，但 Claude Code iOS 模拟器需要完整安装 Xcode。请安装 Xcode，然后运行 `sudo xcode-select -s /Applications/Xcode.app/Contents/Developer`。",
  "Xcode installed": "已安装 Xcode",
  "Xcode is a trademark of Apple Inc., registered in the U.S. and other countries.": "Xcode 是 Apple Inc. 在美国及其他国家/地区注册的商标。",
  "Xcode is installed but hasn't finished setting up. Open Xcode once to finish installing its components, then use the Claude Code iOS Simulator.": "Xcode 已安装但尚未完成设置。请打开一次 Xcode 以完成组件安装，然后再使用 Claude Code iOS Simulator。",
  "Xcode is installed but not selected. Run `sudo xcode-select -s {path}` to use the Claude Code iOS Simulator.": "Xcode 已安装但未被选中。请运行 `sudo xcode-select -s {path}` 来使用 Claude Code iOS 模拟器。",
  "Xcode is installed, but your Mac’s command-line tools don’t point at it. In Xcode, open Settings → Locations and pick your Xcode under Command Line Tools.": "Xcode 已安装，但您 Mac 的命令行工具没有指向它。请在 Xcode 中打开 Settings → Locations，并在 Command Line Tools 下选择您的 Xcode。",
  "Xcode is installed, but your Mac’s command-line tools don’t point at it. Paste this in Terminal — it will ask for your Mac password:": "Xcode 已安装，但您 Mac 的命令行工具并未指向它。请在终端中粘贴以下内容——它会要求输入您的 Mac 密码：",
  "Xcode not found. Install Xcode to use the Claude Code iOS Simulator.": "未找到 Xcode。请安装 Xcode 才能使用 Claude Code iOS 模拟器。",
  "Xcode not found. Install Xcode, then run `sudo xcode-select -s /Applications/Xcode.app/Contents/Developer` to use the Claude Code iOS Simulator. (`xcode-select --print-path` returned \"{path}\", exit {exitStatus}.)": "未找到 Xcode。请安装 Xcode，然后运行 `sudo xcode-select -s /Applications/Xcode.app/Contents/Developer` 以使用 Claude Code iOS 模拟器。（`xcode-select --print-path` 返回了 \"{path}\"，退出码 {exitStatus}。）",
