  "You don't have access to this feature.": "您无权访问此功能。",
  "You don't have access to this repository on GitHub, so it can't be scanned. Click to recheck.": "您在 GitHub 上无权访问此存储库，因此无法扫描。点击重新检查。",
  "You don't have access to this repository on GitHub. Ask a repository admin for access, or pick a different repository.": "您无权访问 GitHub 上的此代码库。请向代码库管理员申请访问权限，或选择其他代码库。",
