  "You haven’t used Sonnet yet": "您还没有使用过 Sonnet",
  "You haven’t used {scope} yet": "您尚未使用过 {scope}",
  "You hit your 5-hour message limit. It resets at {resetTime}, or you can upgrade for higher limits.": "你已达到 5 小时消息限额。它将在 {resetTime} 重置，你也可以升级以获得更高限额。",
  "You hit your message limit. It resets at {resetTime}, or you can upgrade for higher limits.": "您已达到消息限额。限额将在 {resetTime} 重置，或者您可以升级以获得更高额度。",
