  "You hit your spend limit · Limit resets {time}": "您已达到支出限额 · 限额将在 {time} 重置",
  "You hit your weekly Opus limit. It resets at {resetTime} on {resetDay}, or you can upgrade for higher limits.": "您已达到每周 Opus 限额。将于 {resetDay} {resetTime} 重置，或者您可以升级以获得更高限额。",
  "You hit your weekly message limit. It resets at {resetTime} on {resetDay}, or you can upgrade for higher limits.": "你已达到每周消息限额。它将在 {resetDay} {resetTime} 重置，你也可以升级以获得更高限额。",
  "You hit your weekly {model} limit. It resets at {resetTime} on {resetDay}, or you can upgrade for higher limits.": "您已达到 {model} 的每周限额。它会在 {resetDay} {resetTime} 重置，您也可以升级以获得更高限额。",
  "You invited them as an owner in the previous step. Continue to hand sign-in setup to them.": "您在上一步已邀请他们作为所有者。请继续，将登录设置交由他们完成。",
  "You invited them as {role, select, admin {an admin} other {a member}} in the previous step. Setting up sign-in needs an owner, so pick someone else or skip for now.": "您在上一步将他们邀请为{role, select, admin {管理员} other {成员}}。设置登录需要所有者，因此请另选他人或暂时跳过。",
  "You just got access to Claude Code": "您刚获得了 Claude Code 的访问权限",
  "You just got two new features": "您刚刚获得了两项新功能",
  "You just hit your free message limit. Upgrade to Max to send more messages. You also get:": "你刚刚达到免费消息上限。升级到 Max 以发送更多消息。你还将获得：",
  "You just hit your free message limit. Upgrade to Pro (or Max) to send more messages. You also get:": "您刚刚达到了免费消息限制。升级到 Pro（或 Max）以发送更多消息。您还将获得：",
  "You just hit your free message limit. Upgrade to Pro to send more messages. You also get:": "你刚刚达到免费消息上限。升级到 Pro 可发送更多消息。你还将获得：",
  "You keep running notes for your regular 1:1s. I can turn each one into follow-ups and next week’s agenda.": "您一直在为一对一会谈做记录。我可以把每份记录转化为后续事项和下周的议程。",
  "You may not have access to this repository on GitHub, or it may not be in the Claude GitHub App’s selection for your organization. It can’t be scanned. Click to recheck.": "您可能没有 GitHub 上此仓库的访问权限，或者它可能不在您组织的 Claude GitHub App 选中范围内。无法扫描。点击重新检查。",
  "You may not upload files larger than {sizeLimit}mb.": "您不得上传大于 {sizeLimit}MB 的文件。",
  "You mentioned {names}, but they’re not in this project.": "您提到了 {names}，但他们不在此项目中。",
  "You might have received an email that requires you to approve the payment. If that isn’t the case, you can <link>contact support</link>.": "您可能收到了一封需要您批准付款的邮件。如果不是这种情况，您可以<link>联系支持团队</link>。",
  "You must be an owner of a GitHub account to manage the connection.": "您必须是 GitHub 账户的所有者才能管理该连接。",
  "You must be at least 18 years old to create a {planName}.": "您必须年满 18 岁才能创建 {planName}。",
  "You must be at least {minimumAge} years old to create a {planName}.": "你必须年满 {minimumAge} 岁才能创建 {planName}。",
  "You must be at least {minimumAge} years old to use Claude.": "您必须年满 {minimumAge} 岁才能使用 Claude。",
  "You must verify <strong>{domain}</strong> before enabling discoverability for it.": "您必须先验证 <strong>{domain}</strong>，然后才能为其开启发现功能。",
  "You need a Claude account to use this artifact": "您需要 Claude 账号来使用此构件",
  "You need at least {minSeats, plural, one {# seat} other {# seats}} in total.": "您总共至少需要 {minSeats, plural, one {# 个席位} other {# 个席位}}。",
  "You need at least {minSeats} seats in total.": "您总共需要至少 {minSeats} 个席位。",
  "You need the Directory submissions permission in {orgName}": "您需要 {orgName} 中的 Directory 提交权限",
  "You need to be an owner of that organization on GitHub to link it.": "您需要是 GitHub 上该组织的所有者才能链接它。",
  "You need to be an owner of the GitHub organization and an admin of this workspace.": "您需要是 GitHub 组织的所有者，并且是此工作区的管理员。",
  "You need to be an owner of this organization on GitHub to link it.": "您需要是该组织在 GitHub 上的所有者才能关联它。",
  "You need to connect to Outline before using this feature.": "您在使用此功能前需要连接到 Outline。",
  "You no longer have permission to manage this organization’s credentials.": "您不再有权限管理此组织的凭据。",
  "You now have access to {name}. Sign in from the {name} app to get started.": "您现在可以使用 {name} 了。请从 {name} 应用登录以开始使用。",
  "You posted your roll-up every week for the past 4 weeks. I can help research and draft updates for you to review.": "过去 4 周您每周都发布了汇总。我可以帮您研究并起草更新内容，供您审查。",
  "You ran out of usage credits · Limit resets {time}": "您的用量积分已用完 · 限额将在 {time} 重置",
