  "You saved {amount}": "您节省了 {amount}",
  "You selected Read only, but these tools are annotated as writing data (readOnlyHint=false or destructiveHint=true): {tools}. Choose Read and write, or fix the tool annotations on your server.": "您选择了“只读”，但以下工具被标注为会写入数据（readOnlyHint=false 或 destructiveHint=true）：{tools}。请选择“读写”，或在您的服务器上修正这些工具的标注。",
  "You selected Write only, but these tools are annotated as read-only: {tools}. Choose Read and write, or fix the tool annotations on your server.": "你只选择了“写入”，但这些工具被注解为只读：{tools}。请选择“读取和写入”，或在你的服务器上修正工具注解。",
  "You send a note at the start of every week. I can gather the week’s updates and draft it for you.": "您每周开始时都会发送一份纪要。我可以收集本周的更新并为您起草。",
  "You set repo access when you install the Claude GitHub App, and can change it anytime.": "您在安装 Claude GitHub App 时设置仓库访问权限，之后可以随时更改。",
  "You set the direction. Cowork gets it done.": "您设定方向。Cowork 负责完成。",
  "You skipped thinking for this response, so Claude answered directly.": "您在此回复中跳过了思考，因此 Claude 直接作答。",
  "You started connecting to {name} but didn’t finish.": "您已开始连接 {name}，但尚未完成。",
  "You started this in an organization this tab cannot switch to. Sign in to that organization in this browser, then try again.": "您是在此标签页无法切换到的组织中启动的。请在此浏览器中登录该组织，然后重试。",
  "You started this in {org}. This tab is using a different organization. Switch to {org} to continue.": "您在 {org} 中开始了此操作。此标签页正在使用另一个组织。请切换到 {org} 以继续。",
  "You still have credits. Raise the limit to use them": "您还有可用额度。提高限额即可使用",
  "You subscribed through the App Store, so plan changes happen there. Scan the code to open the Claude app on your phone.": "您通过 App Store 订阅，因此套餐变更需要在那里进行。请扫描二维码以在手机上打开 Claude 应用。",
  "You subscribed through the App Store, so plan changes happen there. Tap below to open the Claude app and upgrade.": "您通过 App Store 订阅，因此套餐变更需要在其中进行。点击下方打开 Claude 应用并升级。",
  "You synced recently. Please wait a moment and try again.": "你最近同步过。请稍等片刻后重试。",
  "You synced recently. Try again in {seconds, plural, one {# second} other {# seconds}}.": "你最近已同步过。请在 {seconds, plural, one {# 秒} other {# 秒}}后重试。",
  "You told us when you signed up, so this one’s done. Fix either here if something should read differently.": "您在注册时已告知我们，所以这一项已完成。如果哪里的信息有误，可在此修正。",
  "You unarchived this session, so it isn’t being archived automatically.": "您已取消归档此会话，因此它不会被自动归档。",
  "You updated your answers": "您已更新答案",
