  "Your administrator needs to finish setting up Claude for your organization.": "您的管理员需要为您的组织完成 Claude 的设置。",
  "Your admins at {organizationName} manage who can use it. Ask them for access, then sign in again.": "您在 {organizationName} 的管理员管理着谁可以使用它。请向他们申请访问权限，然后重新登录。",
  "Your admins manage who can use it. Ask them for access, then sign in again.": "由您的管理员管理谁可以使用它。请向他们申请访问权限，然后重新登录。",
  "Your admin’s settings require approval each time for this tool.": "您管理员的设置要求每次使用此工具都需批准。",
  "Your agents": "您的智能体",
  "Your allowlist has extensions but isn’t enforced yet. Turn it on to limit what your team can install.": "您的允许列表中已有扩展，但尚未强制生效。请开启它以限制您的团队可以安装的内容。",
