  "Your application couldn’t be approved. Check that your school and details are correct, and you can try again.": "您的申请未能通过。请检查您的学校和详细信息是否正确，然后可以重试。",
  "Your application couldn’t be submitted. Try again.": "无法提交您的申请。请重试。",
  "Your application expired because verification wasn’t completed in time. You can start over with a new application.": "您的申请已过期，因为验证未及时完成。您可以重新提交一份新申请。",
  "Your application is being reviewed. Watch your email for updates from the verification partner. Most reviews finish within 24 hours, but it can take up to 3 days during busy periods.": "您的申请正在审核中。请留意验证合作伙伴发来的电子邮件更新。大多数审核会在 24 小时内完成，但繁忙时期可能最多需要 3 天。",
  "Your application is in review": "您的申请正在审核中",
  "Your application is under review. We'll email you once it completes, usually within 2 to 3 business days.": "你的申请正在审核中。完成后我们会通过电子邮件通知你，通常需要 2 到 3 个工作日。",
  "Your application is under review. We’ll email you once it completes, usually within 2 to 3 business days.": "您的申请正在审核中。完成后我们会通过邮件通知您，通常需要 2 到 3 个工作日。",
