  "Your billing address wasn’t saved. Please re-enter your address and try again.": "您的账单地址未保存。请重新输入您的地址后重试。",
  "Your billing country requires a different payment region. Update your address and try again.": "你的账单国家/地区要求使用不同的付款区域。请更新地址后重试。",
  "Your branch has uncommitted or unpushed changes. Ask Claude to commit and push them, then try again.": "你的分支有未提交或未推送的更改。请让 Claude 提交并推送它们，然后重试。",
