  "Your browser will ask for permission.": "你的浏览器将请求权限。",
  "Your card verification couldn’t be confirmed yet — nothing was charged. Wait a moment and try again.": "您的银行卡验证暂时无法确认——未收取任何费用。请稍候再试。",
  "Your card was saved but could not be set as default. Please try again.": "你的卡片已保存，但无法设为默认。请重试。",
