  "Your certificate couldn’t be uploaded. Try again.": "无法上传您的证书。请重试。",
  "Your certificate has been submitted. A review will be completed within 2 business days, and the exemption will apply to your account.": "你的证书已提交。审查将在 2 个工作日内完成，免税将应用到你的账户。",
  "Your certificate was verified and applied. Future invoices will reflect the exemption.": "您的证书已验证并应用。今后的发票将反映此免税。",
  "Your changes are being saved. Leaving now won’t stop the save, but you won’t see here whether it succeeded — stay to be sure.": "您的更改正在保存。现在离开不会中断保存，但您将无法在此看到是否成功——请留下以确认。",
  "Your changes have been saved. Claude needs to relaunch to start using them.": "你的更改已保存。Claude 需要重新启动才能开始使用它们。",
