  "Your changes to {name} weren’t saved because they change Git-hook tool settings (lint-staged, husky, commitlint, …), which can’t be saved from here. Make that change in your editor or terminal; other edits to the file save normally.": "您对 {name} 的更改未保存，因为这些更改涉及 Git 钩子工具设置（lint-staged、husky、commitlint 等），无法从这里保存。请在您的编辑器或终端中进行该更改；对文件的其他编辑可正常保存。",
  "Your changes to {name} weren’t saved because this session can’t write to that file. Edit it in your editor or terminal instead.": "您对 {name} 的更改未保存，因为此会话无法写入该文件。请改在您的编辑器或终端中编辑。",
  "Your changes will be saved. Claude needs to relaunch to start using them.": "你的更改将被保存。Claude 需要重新启动才能开始使用它们。",
