  "Your educator verification is no longer active": "您的教育工作者认证已不再有效",
  "Your eligibility confirmation couldn’t be verified. Your device’s date and time may be off — check them, then confirm again.": "无法验证您的资格确认。您的设备日期和时间可能有误——请检查后再确认一次。",
