  "You’ll confirm before anything changes.": "任何更改之前您都会先确认。",
  "You’ll confirm with Touch ID and pick which sites to bring over. Nothing leaves this computer.": "您将通过 Touch ID 确认，并选择要迁移哪些网站。任何数据都不会离开这台电脑。",
  "You’ll confirm, then pick which sites to bring over. Nothing leaves this computer.": "您将先确认，然后选择要迁移哪些站点。任何内容都不会离开这台电脑。",
  "You’ll get a <b>{amount}</b> refund for the rest of this billing period, sent to your original payment method.": "您将获得本计费周期剩余时间的 <b>{amount}</b> 退款，款项会退回您原来的付款方式。",
  "You’ll get a notification for every join request and approve them individually.": "您会收到每个加入请求的通知，并需要逐一审批。",
  "You’ll get a refund for <b>{amount}</b> (plus tax) of your unused usage credits, sent to your original payment method.": "您将收到 <b>{amount}</b>（含税）的未使用用量积分退款，退回到您的原付款方式。",
  "You’ll get an email at {email} when the review finishes. Most reviews finish within 24 hours, though busy periods can take up to 3 days.": "审查完成后，您会在 {email} 收到电子邮件。大多数审查会在 24 小时内完成，繁忙时期可能最多需要 3 天。",
  "You’ll get an invoice with transfer instructions. Your plan starts once payment clears (1 to 5 business days).": "您将收到一张带有转账说明的发票。付款到账（1 到 5 个工作日）后，您的套餐随即开始。",
  "You’ll have the option to pay in your local currency at checkout.": "您可以在结账时选择使用当地货币支付。",
  "You’ll keep Pro until your annual plan ends on {date}, then move to the Free plan.": "在 {date} 年度套餐到期之前，您将保留 Pro，之后会转到 Free 套餐。",
  "You’ll keep Pro until your annual plan ends, then move to the Free plan.": "在年度套餐到期前您将继续保持 Pro，之后会转为免费套餐。",
  "You’ll keep access until {date} and won’t be charged.": "您将保留访问权限直到 {date}，且不会被收费。",
