  "You’ll keep full access to {planName} until your billing period ends on {date}. After that, you’ll move to the Free plan.": "在 {date} 当前计费周期结束前，您将继续拥有 {planName} 的完整访问权限。之后，您将切换到 Free 套餐。",
  "You’ll keep full access to {planName} until your billing period ends. After that, you’ll move to the Free plan.": "在计费周期结束之前，您将继续保留对 {planName} 的完整访问权限。之后，您将转到 Free 套餐。",
  "You’ll keep full access to {productName} until your billing period ends on {nextChargeDate}. After that, you’ll move to the free plan.": "在 {nextChargeDate} 当前计费周期结束前，您可继续完整访问 {productName}。之后，您将转为免费套餐。",
  "You’ll keep the same features and usage limits. Monthly billing starts on {date}, when your annual plan ends.": "您将保留相同的功能和用量限额。月度计费将从 {date}（即您的年度套餐到期时）开始。",
