  "{count, plural, one {{modelNames} is off for the organization.} other {{modelNames} are off for the organization.}}": "{count, plural, one {{modelNames} 已对组织关闭。} other {{modelNames} 已对组织关闭。}}",
  "{count, plural, one {{modelNames}’s maximum effort is above the organization’s maximum for this model. Lower it here, or raise the maximum in Models.} other {The maximum effort for {modelNames} is above the organization’s maximum for those models. Lower it here, or raise the maximums in Models.}}": "{count, plural, one {{modelNames} 的最大思考级别高于组织对此模型的最大值。请在此处调低，或在“模型”中提高最大值。} other {{modelNames} 的最大思考级别高于组织对这些模型的最大值。请在此处调低，或在“模型”中提高最大值。}}",
  "{count, plural, one {{modelNames}’s maximum effort is above the organization’s maximum for this model.} other {The maximum effort for {modelNames} is above the organization’s maximum for those models.}}": "{count, plural, one {{modelNames} 的最大思考级别高于组织为此模型设置的最大值。} other {{modelNames} 的最大思考级别高于组织为这些模型设置的最大值。}}",
  "{count, plural, one {{names} conflicts with the organization’s model settings — resolve it on the Models tab to save.} other {{names} conflict with the organization’s model settings — resolve them on the Models tab to save.}}": "{count, plural, one {{names} 与组织的模型设置冲突——请在“模型”标签页中解决后保存。} other {{names} 与组织的模型设置冲突——请在“模型”标签页中解决后保存。}}",
  "{count, plural, one {{name} can’t be sent as it is. Fix or remove it, then send.} other {# attachments can’t be sent as they are: {names}. Fix or remove them, then send.}}": "{count, plural, one {{name} 按原样无法发送。请修复或移除后再发送。} other {# 个附件按原样无法发送：{names}。请修复或移除后再发送。}}",
  "{count, plural, one {{name} couldn’t be read. Attach it again or remove it, then send.} other {# attachments couldn’t be read: {names}. Attach them again or remove them, then send.}}": "{count, plural, one {无法读取 {name}。请重新附加或将其移除，然后发送。} other {# 个附件无法读取：{names}。请重新附加或将其移除，然后发送。}}",
  "{count, plural, one {{name} couldn’t be uploaded. Try sending again.} other {# attachments couldn’t be uploaded: {names}. Try sending again.}}": "{count, plural, one {{name} 无法上传。请重新发送。} other {# 个附件无法上传：{names}。请重新发送。}}",
  "{count, plural, one {{name} couldn’t be uploaded: the server won’t accept it. Remove it to send the rest.} other {# attachments couldn’t be uploaded: the server won’t accept {names}. Remove them to send the rest.}}": "{count, plural, one {{name} 无法上传：服务器不接受它。请将其移除以发送其余内容。} other {# 个附件无法上传：服务器不接受 {names}。请将其移除以发送其余内容。}}",
  "{count, plural, one {{name} is over a size limit (file size or image dimensions). Remove it to send the rest.} other {# attachments are over a size limit (file size or image dimensions): {names}. Remove them to send the rest.}}": "{count, plural, one {{name} 超过大小限制（文件大小或图片尺寸）。请移除它以发送其余内容。} other {# 个附件超过大小限制（文件大小或图片维度）：{names}。请移除它们以发送其余内容。}}",
