  "{count, plural, one {{roleNames} inherits this model as its default. Turn it back on, or change the organization default.} other {{roleNames} inherit this model as their default. Turn it back on, or change the organization default.}}": "{count, plural, one {{roleNames} 将此模型作为其默认模型继承。请重新启用它，或更改组织默认模型。} other {{roleNames} 将此模型作为其默认模型继承。请重新启用它，或更改组织默认模型。}}",
  "{count, plural, one {{roleNames} uses this as its default model. Enable it for that role here, or change the default in Edit role.} other {{roleNames} use this as their default model. Enable it for those roles here, or change the default in Edit role.}}": "{count, plural, one {{roleNames} 将此作为其默认模型。在此处为该角色启用它，或在“编辑角色”中更改默认设置。} other {{roleNames} 将此作为其默认模型。在此处为这些角色启用它，或在“编辑角色”中更改默认设置。}}",
