  "{fromModelName}’s safeguards flagged this message. This sometimes happens with safe, normal conversations.": "{fromModelName} 的安全防护机制标记了此消息。这种情况有时也会出现在安全、正常的对话中。",
  "{fromModelName}’s safety measures flagged this message. This sometimes happens with safe, normal conversations.": "{fromModelName} 的安全措施标记了此消息。这有时在安全、正常的对话中也会发生。",
