  "{origin, select, phone {It was started on your phone. Link this computer so Claude can use its files and apps.} web {It was started on the web. Link this computer so Claude can use its files and apps.} desktop_unlinked {It couldn’t be linked to a computer when it started. Link this computer so Claude can use its files and apps.} other {Link this computer so Claude can use its files and apps.}}": "{origin, select, phone {它是在您的手机上启动的。请链接此电脑，以便 Claude 使用其文件和应用。} web {它是在网页上启动的。请链接此电脑，以便 Claude 使用其文件和应用。} desktop_unlinked {它启动时无法链接到电脑。请链接此电脑，以便 Claude 使用其文件和应用。} other {请链接此电脑，以便 Claude 使用其文件和应用。}}",
  "{origin, select, web {This task was started on the web, and isn’t linked to this computer. Start a new task here to use files and apps on this computer.} phone {This task was started on your phone, and isn’t linked to this computer. Start a new task here to use files and apps on this computer.} scheduled {This task was started by a scheduled task, and isn’t linked to this computer. Start a new task here to use files and apps on this computer.} desktop_unlinked {This task was started in the desktop app but couldn’t be linked to a computer at the time. Start a new task here to use files and apps on this computer.} other {To use files and apps on your computer, start a new task.}}": "{origin, select, web {此任务是在网页上启动的，未链接到此电脑。请在此启动新任务以使用此电脑上的文件和应用。} phone {此任务是在您的手机上启动的，未链接到此电脑。请在此启动新任务以使用此电脑上的文件和应用。} scheduled {此任务是由计划任务启动的，未链接到此电脑。请在此启动新任务以使用此电脑上的文件和应用。} desktop_unlinked {此任务是在桌面应用中启动的，但当时无法链接到电脑。请在此启动新任务以使用此电脑上的文件和应用。} other {要使用您电脑上的文件和应用，请启动新任务。}}",
