  "{serverLabel} is still running. You can keep it running and re-open a tab any time by entering {host} in the URL bar.": "{serverLabel} 仍在运行。您可以保持它运行，并随时在地址栏输入 {host} 重新打开标签页。",
  "{serverLabel} is still running. You can keep it running and re-open this tab any time by entering {host} in the URL bar.": "{serverLabel} 仍在运行。您可以保持它运行，并随时在地址栏输入 {host} 重新打开此标签页。",
  "{serverName} couldn’t start": "{serverName} 无法启动",
  "{serverName} embed": "{serverName} 嵌入",
  "{serverName} has a custom OAuth Client ID saved, but it’s set up to use automatic client registration. Edit the connector’s auth settings and either remove the custom Client ID or change the registration method.": "{serverName} 保存了自定义 OAuth 客户端 ID，但被设置为使用自动客户端注册。请编辑该连接器的身份验证设置，移除自定义客户端 ID 或更改注册方式。",
  "{serverName} has a sign-in configuration problem. It is set up as not requiring sign-in, but the server requires it. Ask your organization admin to update the connector’s settings.": "{serverName} 存在登录配置问题。它被设置为无需登录，但服务器要求登录。请联系您的组织管理员更新连接器的设置。",
  "{serverName} is set up as not requiring sign-in, but the server asked for sign-in when checked (status {probeStatus}). Update the connector’s auth settings to match how the server behaves.": "{serverName} 被设置为不需要登录，但在检查时服务器要求登录（状态 {probeStatus}）。请更新连接器的身份验证设置以匹配服务器的实际行为。",
  "{serverName} is set up as not requiring sign-in, but the server asked for sign-in when checked. Update the connector’s auth settings to match how the server behaves.": "{serverName} 被设置为不需要登录，但在检查时该服务器要求登录。请更新连接器的身份验证设置，使其与服务器实际行为一致。",
  "{serverName} is set up as not requiring sign-in, but the server requires sign-in when tools are used. Update the connector’s auth settings to match.": "{serverName} 被设置为不需要登录，但该服务器在使用工具时要求登录。请更新连接器的身份验证设置以使其匹配。",
  "{serverName} is set up to use URL-based client registration. The server supports it, but it’s currently turned off on Anthropic’s side. Edit the connector’s auth settings to use a different registration method. This may start working later without any changes.": "{serverName} 被设置为使用基于 URL 的客户端注册。服务器支持此方式，但 Anthropic 方面目前已将其关闭。请编辑该连接器的身份验证设置以改用其他注册方式。之后此功能可能无需任何更改即可恢复。",
  "{serverName} is set up to use a pre-registered OAuth client, but the saved credentials for this connector are missing. If you set this connector up with your own OAuth client, edit the connector’s auth settings and re-enter the OAuth Client ID, plus the client secret if the server issued one. Otherwise this needs a fix on Anthropic’s side.": "{serverName} 被设置为使用预注册的 OAuth 客户端，但此连接器保存的凭据缺失。如果您是用自己的 OAuth 客户端设置此连接器的，请编辑该连接器的身份验证设置，重新输入 OAuth 客户端 ID，若服务器签发了客户端密钥也请一并输入。否则需要 Anthropic 方面修复。",
  "{serverName} is working again, so it wasn’t removed.": "{serverName} 已恢复正常，因此未被移除。",
