  "“{fileName}” is too large. Choose a smaller file.": "“{fileName}”太大。请选择较小的文件。",
  "“{groupName}” will be removed. Sessions in this group will move to Ungrouped.": "“{groupName}”将被移除。此群组中的会话将移至“未分组”。",
  "“{groupName}” will be removed. Sessions in this group will no longer be grouped.": "“{groupName}” 将被移除。此群组中的会话将不再分组。",
  "“{groupName}” will be removed. {count, plural, =0 {Nothing is in it.} one {The # item in it will no longer be grouped.} other {The # items in it will no longer be grouped.}}": "“{groupName}”将被移除。{count, plural, =0 {其中没有任何内容。} one {其中的 # 项将不再分组。} other {其中的 # 项将不再分组。}}",
  "“{host}” did not respond in time. The network path to it is slow or blocked — try again, or switch networks or VPN; if it never responds, check that the machine is on.": "“{host}”未及时响应。通往它的网络路径缓慢或受阻——请重试，或切换网络或 VPN；如果它始终不响应，请检查那台机器是否开机。",
  "“{host}” is asking for a password, one-time code, key passphrase or PIN before it lets you in — nothing is wrong with the settings. Connect and enter it when asked. If you expected an SSH key to sign you in without a prompt, that key was not accepted: check the username in SSH host (user@host), and that the key is loaded in your agent or set under SSH key.": "“{host}”在允许您进入之前要求输入密码、一次性验证码、密钥口令或 PIN——设置本身没有问题。请连接并在提示时输入。如果您原以为 SSH 密钥可以免提示登录，那么该密钥未被接受：请检查 SSH 主机中的用户名（user@host），以及该密钥是否已加载到您的代理中或在 SSH 密钥下设置。",
  "“{host}” now presents a different host key than the one Claude recorded on its first connection. If the machine was reinstalled or re-keyed, connect to it once with ssh in a terminal and accept its new key; Claude uses your known_hosts entry from then on. If nothing changed on that machine, do not connect: something may be intercepting the connection.": "“{host}”现在出示的主机密钥与 Claude 首次连接时记录的不同。如果该机器被重装或重新生成了密钥，请在终端中使用 ssh 连接一次并接受其新密钥；此后 Claude 将使用您的 known_hosts 条目。如果该机器没有任何变更，请勿连接：可能有东西正在拦截连接。",
  "“{host}” refused the connection. Check SSH port, and that an SSH server is running on the machine.": "“{host}”拒绝了连接。请检查 SSH 端口，并确认该计算机上正在运行 SSH 服务器。",
