  "“{taskName}” now runs on this computer, but the cloud copy couldn’t be removed. It’s paused — delete it from the task list.": "“{taskName}”现在在此电脑上运行，但无法移除云端副本。它已暂停——请从任务列表中删除它。",
  "“{taskName}” now runs on this computer. Edit the task to attach local folders.": "“{taskName}”现在在此电脑上运行。请编辑任务以附加本地文件夹。",
  "“{taskName}” now runs on this computer. Tool approvals will be requested again here — edit the task to attach local folders.": "“{taskName}”现在在此电脑上运行。此处会再次请求工具批准——请编辑任务以附加本地文件夹。",
